#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496445 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "17b7a9ee-05d2-5e22-9972-601b4fb37512" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=- \\frac{3 \\cdot 2^{x}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}^{2}} + C x + D + \\frac{5 x^{3}}{6} - 8 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496443} {:answer/id #uuid "98586e82-d740-5cdf-8e68-aec82060ba46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=- \\frac{3 \\cdot 2^{x}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}^{2}} + D + \\frac{5 x^{3}}{6} - 8 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496467} {:answer/id #uuid "a45dd023-ac47-5719-bfa2-a56d75067b69" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=- \\frac{3 \\cdot 2^{x}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}^{2}} + C x + \\frac{5 x^{3}}{6} - 8 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496471} {:answer/id #uuid "e06fa046-2cc1-520d-ad5d-71c843cfdecd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=- \\frac{3 \\cdot 2^{x}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}} + C x + D + \\frac{5 x^{2}}{2} - 4 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496480} {:answer/id #uuid "ef279cf5-32e4-53ca-b8a9-ca1692cb44ce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=\\frac{3 \\cdot 2^{x}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}^{2}} + C x + D - \\frac{5 x^{3}}{6} + 8 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496485}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496443} :answer-field/id #uuid "f54355e5-1536-513f-be27-f9963dda5050" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496487}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "2a8c21f0-1469-51c6-8b1e-9df019a179b7" :question/problem "Solve the differential equation\n\n$$\n4\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=- 12 \\cdot 2^{x} + 20 x + 8 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rearrange the equation to give\n\n$$\n\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=- 3 \\cdot 2^{x} + 5 x + 2 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}.\n$$\n\nNow, integrating the equation once, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(- 3 \\cdot 2^{x} + 5 x + 2 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =((5)\\int \\left(x\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((-3)\\int \\left(2^{x}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((2)\\int \\left(\\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =((5)\\left(\\frac{x^{2}}{2}\\right)) + ((-3)\\left(\\frac{2^{x}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\right)) + ((2)\\left(- 2 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right))+C \\\\  & =- \\frac{3 \\cdot 2^{x}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}} + C + \\frac{5 x^{2}}{2} - 4 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrating a second time, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(- \\frac{3 \\cdot 2^{x}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}} + C + \\frac{5 x^{2}}{2} - 4 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y & =(\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)\\int \\left(x^{2}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + (\\left(- \\frac{3}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\right)\\int \\left(2^{x}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((-4)\\int \\left(\\cos{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x)+C\\int \\text{d}x \\\\  & =(\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)\\left(\\frac{x^{3}}{3}\\right)) + (\\left(- \\frac{3}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\right)\\left(\\frac{2^{x}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\right)) + ((-4)\\left(2 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right))+Cx+D \\\\  & =- \\frac{3 \\cdot 2^{x}}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}^{2}} + C x + D + \\frac{5 x^{3}}{6} - 8 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that because we had a second-order equation, our general solution contains *two* arbitrary constants, $C$ and $D.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496457 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3a018671-33dd-5e1e-a486-47ea10f91d83" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=D - \\frac{x^{3}}{6} - \\frac{7 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4} - 2 e^{- 2 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496446} {:answer/id #uuid "96e035ed-98be-559e-afe9-4fdf3c466757" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x + D - \\frac{x^{2}}{2} + \\frac{7 \\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2} + 4 e^{- 2 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496465} {:answer/id #uuid "98d9400f-9d5a-5d32-9ef8-18683c25276d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x - \\frac{x^{3}}{6} - \\frac{7 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4} - 2 e^{- 2 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496468} {:answer/id #uuid "9d88d181-065b-5b99-9c3d-def935f9acf7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x + D - \\frac{x^{3}}{6} - \\frac{7 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4} - 2 e^{- 2 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496470} {:answer/id #uuid "ab12cfcf-d837-5893-98cc-7bf52f85922b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x + D + \\frac{x^{3}}{6} + \\frac{7 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4} + 2 e^{- 2 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496473}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496470} :answer-field/id #uuid "c862d365-4036-51de-9a7d-af7d82638b2d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496476}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "64d2112b-6455-564b-a00e-e1e0242afaf1" :question/problem "Solve the differential equation\n\n$$\n2\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=- 2 x + 14 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)} - 16 e^{- 2 x}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rearrange the equation to give\n\n$$\n\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=- x + 7 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)} - 8 e^{- 2 x}.\n$$\n\nNow, integrating the equation once, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(- x + 7 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)} - 8 e^{- 2 x}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =((-1)\\int \\left(x\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((-8)\\int \\left(e^{- 2 x}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((7)\\int \\left(\\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =((-1)\\left(\\frac{x^{2}}{2}\\right)) + ((-8)\\left(- \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}\\right)) + ((7)\\left(\\frac{\\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}\\right))+C \\\\  & =C - \\frac{x^{2}}{2} + \\frac{7 \\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2} + 4 e^{- 2 x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrating a second time, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(C - \\frac{x^{2}}{2} + \\frac{7 \\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2} + 4 e^{- 2 x}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y & =(\\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\int \\left(x^{2}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((4)\\int \\left(e^{- 2 x}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + (\\left(\\frac{7}{2}\\right)\\int \\left(\\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x)+C\\int \\text{d}x \\\\  & =(\\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\left(\\frac{x^{3}}{3}\\right)) + ((4)\\left(- \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}\\right)) + (\\left(\\frac{7}{2}\\right)\\left(- \\frac{\\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}\\right))+Cx+D \\\\  & =C x + D - \\frac{x^{3}}{6} - \\frac{7 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{4} - 2 e^{- 2 x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that because we had a second-order equation, our general solution contains *two* arbitrary constants, $C$ and $D.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496459 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "47d92b48-ec79-52ab-a285-33d507f81dd6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x + D - \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496449} {:answer/id #uuid "7b45ba37-d4e1-534a-a901-557a1c17a7d6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x + D + \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496460} {:answer/id #uuid "8a313bb8-d9a1-533b-b56d-8892fa941211" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=D - \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496464} {:answer/id #uuid "be37962b-6efd-515c-a571-a13f146db634" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x - \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496475} {:answer/id #uuid "eaa554b3-4a68-5807-bb3b-0cf90a40cca0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x + D + \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496483}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496449} :answer-field/id #uuid "477df44a-11a1-5101-aade-bfbe97b75816" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496448}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "76795e9c-6c55-5ca7-a4fc-d6d343e2c852" :question/problem "Solve the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=- e^{- 2 x}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Integrating the equation once, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(- e^{- 2 x}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =((-1)\\int \\left(e^{- 2 x}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =((-1)\\left(- \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}\\right))+C \\\\  & =C + \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrating a second time, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(C + \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y & =(\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\int \\left(e^{- 2 x}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x)+C\\int \\text{d}x \\\\  & =(\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\left(- \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}\\right))+Cx+D \\\\  & =C x + D - \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that because we had a second-order equation, our general solution contains *two* arbitrary constants, $C$ and $D.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496461 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "431e3f50-9697-534f-b81d-9a9818b4b4f0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x + D + \\frac{x^{6}}{15} + \\frac{2 x^{5}}{5} - \\frac{2 \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{9}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496447} {:answer/id #uuid "4f7877ce-f2f4-5a6c-bc6c-70bfe99570ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x + D - \\frac{x^{6}}{15} - \\frac{2 x^{5}}{5} + \\frac{2 \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{9}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496452} {:answer/id #uuid "84ba00bd-ae03-5a27-bcc9-49ecdcd0d954" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x + D - \\frac{2 x^{5}}{5} - 2 x^{4} + \\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496462} {:answer/id #uuid "9c2b08ce-e008-5a63-b350-3f4ff774087b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=D - \\frac{x^{6}}{15} - \\frac{2 x^{5}}{5} + \\frac{2 \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{9}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496469} {:answer/id #uuid "d5b497df-f5b4-5a27-8162-1ef52bf3b6b9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x - \\frac{x^{6}}{15} - \\frac{2 x^{5}}{5} + \\frac{2 \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{9}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496477}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496452} :answer-field/id #uuid "553b156e-b41f-5b74-a709-a7550e26968b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496454}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "7b9b05e0-1d53-595d-87f6-fcb0ea344f67" :question/problem "Solve the differential equation\n\n$$\n3\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=- 6 x^{4} - 24 x^{3} - 6 \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rearrange the equation to give\n\n$$\n\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=- 2 x^{4} - 8 x^{3} - 2 \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nNow, integrating the equation once, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(- 2 x^{4} - 8 x^{3} - 2 \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =((-8)\\int \\left(x^{3}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((-2)\\int \\left(x^{4}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((-2)\\int \\left(\\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =((-8)\\left(\\frac{x^{4}}{4}\\right)) + ((-2)\\left(\\frac{x^{5}}{5}\\right)) + ((-2)\\left(- \\frac{\\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}\\right))+C \\\\  & =C - \\frac{2 x^{5}}{5} - 2 x^{4} + \\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrating a second time, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(C - \\frac{2 x^{5}}{5} - 2 x^{4} + \\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y & =((-2)\\int \\left(x^{4}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + (\\left(- \\frac{2}{5}\\right)\\int \\left(x^{5}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + (\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)\\int \\left(\\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x)+C\\int \\text{d}x \\\\  & =((-2)\\left(\\frac{x^{5}}{5}\\right)) + (\\left(- \\frac{2}{5}\\right)\\left(\\frac{x^{6}}{6}\\right)) + (\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)\\left(\\frac{\\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}\\right))+Cx+D \\\\  & =C x + D - \\frac{x^{6}}{15} - \\frac{2 x^{5}}{5} + \\frac{2 \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that because we had a second-order equation, our general solution contains *two* arbitrary constants, $C$ and $D.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496474 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "16c97bc6-f60d-54c4-b7a0-0109b8b665a3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x + D + \\frac{3 x^{4}}{2} + 4 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} - 12 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496442} {:answer/id #uuid "52effbc3-75dd-51c0-8b3c-224c3cd54fd3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x + \\frac{3 x^{5}}{10} + 8 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} + 24 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496453} {:answer/id #uuid "706eaced-8e8c-52e2-bfea-e59cc1590246" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x + D + \\frac{3 x^{5}}{10} + 8 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} + 24 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496458} {:answer/id #uuid "96fe4e2b-4cff-525b-8ad1-4de8638750aa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x + D - \\frac{3 x^{5}}{10} - 8 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} - 24 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496466} {:answer/id #uuid "d82f188a-2305-57a9-8ca5-cb043c85d10d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=D + \\frac{3 x^{5}}{10} + 8 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} + 24 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496478}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496458} :answer-field/id #uuid "e387b32c-b692-5d4f-ab95-49c805f1cfd0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496481}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "adfc6c39-9c84-5054-86dc-08ce214860eb" :question/problem "Solve the differential equation\n\n$$\n4\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=24 x^{3} - 8 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} + 24 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rearrange the equation to give\n\n$$\n\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=6 x^{3} - 2 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} + 6 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}.\n$$\n\nNow, integrating the equation once, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(6 x^{3} - 2 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} + 6 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =((6)\\int \\left(x^{3}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((6)\\int \\left(e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((-2)\\int \\left(\\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =((6)\\left(\\frac{x^{4}}{4}\\right)) + ((6)\\left(- 2 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\right)) + ((-2)\\left(- 2 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right))+C \\\\  & =C + \\frac{3 x^{4}}{2} + 4 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} - 12 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrating a second time, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(C + \\frac{3 x^{4}}{2} + 4 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} - 12 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y & =(\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\int \\left(x^{4}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((-12)\\int \\left(e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((4)\\int \\left(\\cos{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x)+C\\int \\text{d}x \\\\  & =(\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\left(\\frac{x^{5}}{5}\\right)) + ((-12)\\left(- 2 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}\\right)) + ((4)\\left(2 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right))+Cx+D \\\\  & =C x + D + \\frac{3 x^{5}}{10} + 8 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)} + 24 e^{- \\frac{x}{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that because we had a second-order equation, our general solution contains *two* arbitrary constants, $C$ and $D.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496486 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "481097fd-f9ae-55d3-8f5c-722e350c0b5f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=D - \\frac{4 x^{6}}{15} - \\frac{3 x^{5}}{10} - \\frac{\\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496450} {:answer/id #uuid "49e876e9-eec7-5526-ad6f-32142b42b519" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x - \\frac{4 x^{6}}{15} - \\frac{3 x^{5}}{10} - \\frac{\\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496451} {:answer/id #uuid "55ca0676-4986-53de-8bfe-c98830d32367" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x + D - \\frac{4 x^{6}}{15} - \\frac{3 x^{5}}{10} - \\frac{\\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496455} {:answer/id #uuid "8922d260-2923-5acd-b341-65d16531156a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x + D + \\frac{4 x^{6}}{15} + \\frac{3 x^{5}}{10} + \\frac{\\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496463} {:answer/id #uuid "fe2e2fff-1806-5d13-b4de-becd24629d8a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "y=C x + D - \\frac{8 x^{5}}{5} - \\frac{3 x^{4}}{2} + \\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496489}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496455} :answer-field/id #uuid "fad2a396-3caa-5aaa-b023-a60543b5a4e7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496488}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "f11b903b-958d-5c91-a4bb-2c7b220c4cab" :question/problem "Solve the differential equation\n\n$$\n2\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=- 16 x^{4} - 12 x^{3} + 4 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rearrange the equation to give\n\n$$\n\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=- 8 x^{4} - 6 x^{3} + 2 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}.\n$$\n\nNow, integrating the equation once, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(- 8 x^{4} - 6 x^{3} + 2 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =((-6)\\int \\left(x^{3}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((-8)\\int \\left(x^{4}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((2)\\int \\left(\\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =((-6)\\left(\\frac{x^{4}}{4}\\right)) + ((-8)\\left(\\frac{x^{5}}{5}\\right)) + ((2)\\left(\\frac{\\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}\\right))+C \\\\  & =C - \\frac{8 x^{5}}{5} - \\frac{3 x^{4}}{2} + \\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrating a second time, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(C - \\frac{8 x^{5}}{5} - \\frac{3 x^{4}}{2} + \\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y & =(\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\int \\left(x^{4}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + (\\left(- \\frac{8}{5}\\right)\\int \\left(x^{5}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x) + ((1)\\int \\left(\\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x)+C\\int \\text{d}x \\\\  & =(\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\left(\\frac{x^{5}}{5}\\right)) + (\\left(- \\frac{8}{5}\\right)\\left(\\frac{x^{6}}{6}\\right)) + ((1)\\left(- \\frac{\\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}\\right))+Cx+D \\\\  & =C x + D - \\frac{4 x^{6}}{15} - \\frac{3 x^{5}}{10} - \\frac{\\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that because we had a second-order equation, our general solution contains *two* arbitrary constants, $C$ and $D.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496495 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "703c4065-6a5d-5d85-b097-7bbf9d11c7f6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=3 x^{2} - 6 x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496513} {:answer/id #uuid "7702e446-2f35-5f48-8c0e-793922a67609" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=x^{3} - 3 x^{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496516} {:answer/id #uuid "98381d2b-0c4d-53f2-aa3a-75c503cdbbe8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- 3 x^{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496522} {:answer/id #uuid "9c42ac33-202a-55ab-9e62-9f30f3f58fbf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=9 x^{3} - 12 x^{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496525} {:answer/id #uuid "e50eaf70-2445-548f-b86c-1e9e5899495c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- x^{3} + 3 x^{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496542}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496516} :answer-field/id #uuid "ce7f7235-e7cb-5569-b97b-caa4d45fcf30" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496534}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "179f19da-330e-5f5e-a1f0-62959c022ecc" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation $f'(x)=- 6 x+3 x^{2}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that the derivative term is already isolated on the left:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f'(x) &=- 6 x+3 x^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides of the equation with respect to $x,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int f\\prime(x)\\,\\text{d}x &=\\int (- 6 x+3 x^{2})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ f(x) &=\\int (- 6 x)\\,\\text{d}x+\\int (3 x^{2})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ &=1\\cdot \\left(- 3 x^{2}\\right)+1\\cdot \\left(x^{3}\\right)+C \\\\ &=- 3 x^{2}+x^{3}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496501 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1b79c936-6102-58b3-9ac8-17efa93ea75d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=\\frac{2 x^{3}}{5} + \\frac{4 x^{2}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496497} {:answer/id #uuid "42996f87-8846-58b5-ab26-947cd6e97787" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=\\frac{2 x^{3}}{5} + \\frac{4 x^{2}}{5} + \\frac{e^{- 4 x}}{10}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496506} {:answer/id #uuid "9a5163bf-cda3-5ec3-bfb9-31a821690e2c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- \\frac{2 x^{3}}{5} - \\frac{4 x^{2}}{5} - \\frac{e^{- 4 x}}{10}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496523} {:answer/id #uuid "d16868fe-1cee-5628-8c3f-db810e35b375" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=\\frac{18 x^{3}}{5} + \\frac{16 x^{2}}{5} + \\frac{8 e^{- 4 x}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496536} {:answer/id #uuid "db703725-3204-55e9-82a3-dc14b98cb2c7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=\\frac{6 x^{2}}{5} + \\frac{8 x}{5} - \\frac{2 e^{- 4 x}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496538}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496506} :answer-field/id #uuid "1b4cc95d-b2b6-5143-b004-a3c38fe0a2cd" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496496}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "26aabf44-e4b2-5317-9f49-dff75af11f88" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation $5f'(x)=8 x+6 x^{2}- 2 e^{- 4 x}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rearrange the equation to isolate the derivative term:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f'(x) &=\\frac{8 x}{5}+\\frac{6 x^{2}}{5}- \\frac{2 e^{- 4 x}}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides of the equation with respect to $x,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int f\\prime(x)\\,\\text{d}x &=\\int (\\frac{8 x}{5}+\\frac{6 x^{2}}{5}- \\frac{2 e^{- 4 x}}{5})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ f(x) &=\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\int (8 x)\\,\\text{d}x+\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\int (6 x^{2})\\,\\text{d}x+\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\int (- 2 e^{- 4 x})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ &=\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\left(4 x^{2}\\right)+\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\left(2 x^{3}\\right)+\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\left(\\frac{e^{- 4 x}}{2}\\right)+C \\\\ &=\\frac{4 x^{2}}{5}+\\frac{2 x^{3}}{5}+\\frac{e^{- 4 x}}{10}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496505 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0d32326d-f8f7-50a3-985e-b1e1d37cdc2a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- \\frac{4 x^{2}}{3} + 4 e^{4 x} + \\frac{\\ln{\\left(\\left|{x - 2}\\right| \\right)}}{18}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496492} {:answer/id #uuid "1126b502-7a36-55b9-9de4-2391d8cb1c34" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- \\frac{2 x}{3} + e^{4 x} + \\frac{2}{x - 2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496493} {:answer/id #uuid "38d904cc-8188-5c23-8d1a-2ce92740dcf8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=\\frac{x^{2}}{3} - \\frac{e^{4 x}}{4} - 2 \\ln{\\left(\\left|{x - 2}\\right| \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496504} {:answer/id #uuid "478bff4b-1f38-511e-8a4f-a99b90f1c64c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- \\frac{x^{2}}{3} + \\frac{e^{4 x}}{4} + 2 \\ln{\\left(\\left|{x - 2}\\right| \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496508} {:answer/id #uuid "ccda3c2e-69cf-54f3-a968-ffd12e0b8c89" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=\\frac{e^{4 x}}{4} + 2 \\ln{\\left(\\left|{x - 2}\\right| \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496533}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496508} :answer-field/id #uuid "f31a20d1-c2da-5d37-9f86-6795a15d4026" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496547}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "3b7e5e08-6941-58d2-a73a-e51fbed395c6" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation $-3f'(x)=- \\frac{6}{x - 2}- 3 e^{4 x}+2 x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rearrange the equation to isolate the derivative term:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f'(x) &=\\frac{2}{x - 2}+e^{4 x}- \\frac{2 x}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides of the equation with respect to $x,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int f\\prime(x)\\,\\text{d}x &=\\int (\\frac{2}{x - 2}+e^{4 x}- \\frac{2 x}{3})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ f(x) &=- \\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\int \\left(- \\frac{6}{x - 2}\\right)\\,\\text{d}x- \\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\int (- 3 e^{4 x})\\,\\text{d}x- \\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\int (2 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ &=- \\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\left(- 6 \\ln{\\left(\\left|{x - 2}\\right| \\right)}\\right)- \\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\left(- \\frac{3 e^{4 x}}{4}\\right)- \\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\left(x^{2}\\right)+C \\\\ &=2 \\ln{\\left(\\left|{x - 2}\\right| \\right)}+\\frac{e^{4 x}}{4}- \\frac{x^{2}}{3}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496511 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2781158b-ed36-5958-9c24-80295a88ff1c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- 3 x - e^{4 x} - 2 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496502} {:answer/id #uuid "2e0188b2-f462-583f-ba36-947c61640e08" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- \\frac{3 x^{2}}{2} - \\frac{e^{4 x}}{4} + \\frac{\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496503} {:answer/id #uuid "c726202f-5466-5700-acb3-6b0e3ee77da0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- 6 x^{2} - 4 e^{4 x} + 8 \\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496531} {:answer/id #uuid "d451bb1c-c06e-5ae1-a856-2cebff6e5005" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- \\frac{e^{4 x}}{4} + \\frac{\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496537} {:answer/id #uuid "f9590a88-af9c-5623-bfb5-8c29ef8f1648" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=\\frac{3 x^{2}}{2} + \\frac{e^{4 x}}{4} - \\frac{\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496551}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496503} :answer-field/id #uuid "af408359-6cd4-50d7-8fe9-1c6c48815da1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496529}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "5632b827-4db2-5a94-a24f-f0f2cc425ab3" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation $-2f'(x)=4 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}+2 e^{4 x}+6 x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rearrange the equation to isolate the derivative term:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f'(x) &=- 2 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}- e^{4 x}- 3 x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides of the equation with respect to $x,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int f\\prime(x)\\,\\text{d}x &=\\int (- 2 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}- e^{4 x}- 3 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ f(x) &=- \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\int (4 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)})\\,\\text{d}x- \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\int (2 e^{4 x})\\,\\text{d}x- \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\int (6 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ &=- \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\left(- \\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)- \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\left(\\frac{e^{4 x}}{2}\\right)- \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\left(3 x^{2}\\right)+C \\\\ &=\\frac{\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{2}- \\frac{e^{4 x}}{4}- \\frac{3 x^{2}}{2}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496514 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "05498781-0f1b-597d-99f4-6d281558c106" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- 6 \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496491} {:answer/id #uuid "1440623a-d086-5fe2-bad5-cae097e51159" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=18 \\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496494} {:answer/id #uuid "43281c01-5636-511d-8e63-cebcbb43941c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=2 \\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496507} {:answer/id #uuid "81b44495-5ebc-5403-b11b-641127a5c037" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- 2 \\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496518} {:answer/id #uuid "864eb041-cbf6-5341-85f6-d4b856cc71df" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- \\frac{\\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496519}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496507} :answer-field/id #uuid "48649361-838b-599d-b10f-05e824c45568" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496509}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "70f93883-9ca9-59c0-961f-68163c994aa7" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation $f'(x)=- 6 \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that the derivative term is already isolated on the left:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f'(x) &=- 6 \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides of the equation with respect to $x,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int f\\prime(x)\\,\\text{d}x &=\\int (- 6 \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ f(x) &=\\int (- 6 \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ &=1\\cdot \\left(2 \\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\right)+C \\\\ &=2 \\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496539 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "516116c9-f2ed-5c02-a0c6-89cc7b3b975f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=4 x^{2} - 24 e^{3 x}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496510} {:answer/id #uuid "c736e002-8978-541b-a258-65d1e45fd4cd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=x^{2} - \\frac{8 e^{3 x}}{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496532} {:answer/id #uuid "cff0d720-fa5f-5b17-a748-a1ea6d70792c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- \\frac{8 e^{3 x}}{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496535} {:answer/id #uuid "e42b879f-3611-5d39-b929-1caa970738d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- x^{2} + \\frac{8 e^{3 x}}{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496541} {:answer/id #uuid "ff41bc05-baef-5a3b-b44b-d8bee4309a0f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=2 x - 8 e^{3 x}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496553}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496532} :answer-field/id #uuid "aab4f6b8-570e-5582-8f4c-e67092f9ae5c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496528}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "dc21474b-d455-5fce-b538-e7ab170be80c" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation $f'(x)=- 8 e^{3 x}+2 x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that the derivative term is already isolated on the left:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f'(x) &=- 8 e^{3 x}+2 x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides of the equation with respect to $x,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int f\\prime(x)\\,\\text{d}x &=\\int (- 8 e^{3 x}+2 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ f(x) &=\\int (- 8 e^{3 x})\\,\\text{d}x+\\int (2 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ &=1\\cdot \\left(- \\frac{8 e^{3 x}}{3}\\right)+1\\cdot \\left(x^{2}\\right)+C \\\\ &=- \\frac{8 e^{3 x}}{3}+x^{2}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496544 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "22c6e31d-a4ee-55ca-8606-d24f97c88073" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=16 x^{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496500} {:answer/id #uuid "8ad55cef-7a88-5b78-9925-d6fbeaf2e568" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=8 x+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496520} {:answer/id #uuid "9b175360-a0a2-5506-8689-951930bc656e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=\\frac{x^{2}}{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496524} {:answer/id #uuid "c4c1210f-6629-515b-9bc5-1a7b6eac482a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=4 x^{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496530} {:answer/id #uuid "f1a30b57-6ce0-5c54-904b-c91e933e9b7b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- 4 x^{2}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496546}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496530} :answer-field/id #uuid "71257e6a-7d7b-50aa-9c19-e6143a087bf4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496515}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "efaa08c6-5d83-5f61-899a-e98ffe7a703d" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation $f'(x)=8 x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that the derivative term is already isolated on the left:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f'(x) &=8 x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides of the equation with respect to $x,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int f\\prime(x)\\,\\text{d}x &=\\int (8 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ f(x) &=\\int (8 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ &=1\\cdot \\left(4 x^{2}\\right)+C \\\\ &=4 x^{2}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496549 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "655c69d4-326e-52b0-81f2-8daf5cb15e8e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=\\frac{2 e^{3 x}}{9} - \\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496512} {:answer/id #uuid "7c9bdc9d-5a36-5a24-9a03-02ad2480cd95" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=\\frac{8 x^{2}}{3} + 2 e^{3 x} - \\frac{32 \\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496517} {:answer/id #uuid "a3b929cc-4add-5e77-87f5-ac32c3b24552" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- \\frac{2 x^{2}}{3} - \\frac{2 e^{3 x}}{9} + \\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496527} {:answer/id #uuid "dfd80e8c-5c62-553a-b990-6bbd3722b045" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=\\frac{2 x^{2}}{3} + \\frac{2 e^{3 x}}{9} - \\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496540} {:answer/id #uuid "f8724c5b-3f9e-58d5-9ecf-89fb0aa57785" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=\\frac{4 x}{3} + \\frac{2 e^{3 x}}{3} + \\frac{8 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{3}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496550}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496540} :answer-field/id #uuid "20ac9012-5436-5190-aee8-8281451a0097" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496499}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "f75c8277-6f32-5092-acf6-0560703c8b10" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation $3f'(x)=8 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}+2 e^{3 x}+4 x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rearrange the equation to isolate the derivative term:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f'(x) &=\\frac{8 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{3}+\\frac{2 e^{3 x}}{3}+\\frac{4 x}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides of the equation with respect to $x,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int f\\prime(x)\\,\\text{d}x &=\\int (\\frac{8 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{3}+\\frac{2 e^{3 x}}{3}+\\frac{4 x}{3})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ f(x) &=\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\int (8 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)})\\,\\text{d}x+\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\int (2 e^{3 x})\\,\\text{d}x+\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\int (4 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ &=\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\left(- 2 \\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)+\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\left(\\frac{2 e^{3 x}}{3}\\right)+\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\left(2 x^{2}\\right)+C \\\\ &=- \\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{3}+\\frac{2 e^{3 x}}{9}+\\frac{2 x^{2}}{3}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496552 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1d9939f3-71f9-5ef9-944c-f29e05fe4152" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- \\frac{24 x^{3}}{5} - \\frac{12 x^{2}}{5} + \\frac{4 e^{2 x}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496498} {:answer/id #uuid "8deda811-4331-518b-937c-85237a299cc3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- \\frac{8 x^{3}}{15} - \\frac{3 x^{2}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496521} {:answer/id #uuid "a35314e6-3ac6-503e-9168-c5691bd336fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- \\frac{8 x^{2}}{5} - \\frac{6 x}{5} + \\frac{2 e^{2 x}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496526} {:answer/id #uuid "e84c93d9-8649-5fcb-942a-0afdb6ea40f1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=\\frac{8 x^{3}}{15} + \\frac{3 x^{2}}{5} - \\frac{e^{2 x}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496543} {:answer/id #uuid "f16cc34f-f3a2-502d-aaf6-c74e0b629fa7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- \\frac{8 x^{3}}{15} - \\frac{3 x^{2}}{5} + \\frac{e^{2 x}}{5}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496545}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496545} :answer-field/id #uuid "f41a4546-e8c4-53b7-9d92-f0e17adf0540" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496548}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "fdf2fccf-758d-5b24-a333-437fd096ef99" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation $-5f'(x)=6 x+8 x^{2}- 2 e^{2 x}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rearrange the equation to isolate the derivative term:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f'(x) &=- \\frac{6 x}{5}- \\frac{8 x^{2}}{5}+\\frac{2 e^{2 x}}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides of the equation with respect to $x,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int f\\prime(x)\\,\\text{d}x &=\\int (- \\frac{6 x}{5}- \\frac{8 x^{2}}{5}+\\frac{2 e^{2 x}}{5})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ f(x) &=- \\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\int (6 x)\\,\\text{d}x- \\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\int (8 x^{2})\\,\\text{d}x- \\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\int (- 2 e^{2 x})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ &=- \\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\left(3 x^{2}\\right)- \\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\left(\\frac{8 x^{3}}{3}\\right)- \\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\left(- e^{2 x}\\right)+C \\\\ &=- \\frac{3 x^{2}}{5}- \\frac{8 x^{3}}{15}+\\frac{e^{2 x}}{5}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496555 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d4ef27c0-c2ac-5049-b6d0-b6c6c30dbda8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "- 3 x^{2} - 5 + e^{- 2 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496584}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496584} :answer-field/id #uuid "7761440a-3e1f-5b63-807b-471d79bc3612" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496571}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "055460a6-0f9b-526b-8dc4-1d9477fd930a" :question/problem "Find the particular solution to the differential equation $y'=- 6 x- 2 e^{- 2 x}$ that satisfies the condition $y(0)=-4.$\n\n$y=\\,${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The derivative is already isolated, so we have\n\n$$\ny'=- 6 x- 2 e^{- 2 x}.\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x,$ and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int y'\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (- 6 x- 2 e^{- 2 x})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ y & =\\int (- 6 x)\\,\\text{d}x + \\int (- 2 e^{- 2 x})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ & =(-6)\\left(\\frac{x^{2}}{2}\\right) + (-2)\\left(- \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}\\right)+C \\\\ & =- 3 x^{2}+e^{- 2 x}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo our general solution is $y=- 3 x^{2}+e^{- 2 x}+C.$ To find a particular solution, we substitute the condition $y(0)=-4$ into our solution and obtain a value for $C,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-4 & =(- 3 (0)^{2}) + (e^{- 2 (0)})+C \\\\ -4 & =(0) + (1)+C \\\\ C & =-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our particular solution is\n\n$$\ny=- 3 x^{2} - 5 + e^{- 2 x}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496558 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "44d307e3-3971-5b44-8870-ec07964729c5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "g(x)=- \\frac{4 x^{3}}{3} + \\frac{e^{2 x}}{2} - 2 \\sin{(x )} - \\frac{5}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496560} {:answer/id #uuid "6309219f-5921-50af-8d03-ceca3f9cd7cd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "g(x)=4 x^{2} - e^{2 x} + 2 \\cos{(x )} - 3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496565} {:answer/id #uuid "6d39cea8-f729-59fd-932b-b421f7c81e0a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "g(x)=\\frac{4 x^{3}}{3} - \\frac{e^{2 x}}{2} + 2 \\sin{(x )}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496566} {:answer/id #uuid "9bf52bf4-503f-518b-8224-990dfc17f0e2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "g(x)=\\frac{4 x^{3}}{3} - \\frac{e^{2 x}}{2} + 2 \\sin{(x )} - \\frac{3}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496578} {:answer/id #uuid "d8a8c8a0-b258-57db-8417-7f4ed7dd5e10" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "g(x)=\\frac{2 x^{3}}{3} - \\frac{e^{2 x}}{4} + \\sin{(x )} - \\frac{7}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496586}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496578} :answer-field/id #uuid "b3e4d76e-d5c8-50ce-b204-2238bbc1ebf6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496580}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "28dcb28d-1db1-599d-9052-a43879b7d29d" :question/problem "Find the particular solution to the differential equation $g'(x)=4 x^{2}- e^{2 x}+2 \\cos{(x )}$ that satisfies the condition $g(0)=-2.$" :question/worked-solution "The derivative is already isolated, so we have\n\n$$\ng'(x)=4 x^{2}- e^{2 x}+2 \\cos{(x )}.\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x,$ and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int g'(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (4 x^{2}- e^{2 x}+2 \\cos{(x )})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ g(x) & =\\int (4 x^{2})\\,\\text{d}x + \\int (- e^{2 x})\\,\\text{d}x + \\int (2 \\cos{(x )})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ & =(4)\\left(\\frac{x^{3}}{3}\\right) + (-1)\\left(\\frac{e^{2 x}}{2}\\right) + (2)(\\sin{(x )})+C \\\\ & =\\frac{4 x^{3}}{3}- \\frac{e^{2 x}}{2}+2 \\sin{(x )}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo our general solution is $$\n\\displaystyle g(x)=\\frac{4 x^{3}}{3}- \\frac{e^{2 x}}{2}+2 \\sin{(x )}+C.\n$$ To find a particular solution, we substitute the condition $g(0)=-2$ into our solution and obtain a value for $C,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2 & =\\left(\\frac{4 (0)^{3}}{3}\\right) + \\left(- \\frac{e^{2 (0)}}{2}\\right) + (2 \\sin{((0) )})+C \\\\ -2 & =(0) + \\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right) + (0)+C \\\\ C & =- \\frac{3}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our particular solution is\n\n$$\ng(x)=\\frac{4 x^{3}}{3} - \\frac{e^{2 x}}{2} + 2 \\sin{(x )} - \\frac{3}{2}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496559 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e7a616ea-75de-59d6-9be8-1efebdcb8ea9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "- \\frac{2 x^{3}}{3} + e^{x} + 3 \\sin{(x )} - 2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496587}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496587} :answer-field/id #uuid "cb17feec-f119-512b-bbc3-1c49567bcc7a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496583}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "434627b4-46f1-5eea-a26e-ab4e978bb4fe" :question/problem "Find the particular solution to the differential equation $f'(x)=- 2 x^{2}+e^{x}+3 \\cos{(x )}$ that satisfies the condition $f(0)=-1.$\n\n$f(x)=\\,${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The derivative is already isolated, so we have\n\n$$\nf'(x)=- 2 x^{2}+e^{x}+3 \\cos{(x )}.\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x,$ and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int f'(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (- 2 x^{2}+e^{x}+3 \\cos{(x )})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ f(x) & =\\int (- 2 x^{2})\\,\\text{d}x + \\int (e^{x})\\,\\text{d}x + \\int (3 \\cos{(x )})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ & =(-2)\\left(\\frac{x^{3}}{3}\\right) + (1)(e^{x}) + (3)(\\sin{(x )})+C \\\\ & =- \\frac{2 x^{3}}{3}+e^{x}+3 \\sin{(x )}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo our general solution is $f(x)=- \\frac{2 x^{3}}{3}+e^{x}+3 \\sin{(x )}+C.$ To find a particular solution, we substitute the condition $f(0)=-1$ into our solution and obtain a value for $C,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1 & =\\left(- \\frac{2 (0)^{3}}{3}\\right) + (e^{(0)}) + (3 \\sin{((0) )})+C \\\\ -1 & =(0) + (1) + (0)+C \\\\ C & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our particular solution is\n\n$$\nf(x)=- \\frac{2 x^{3}}{3} + e^{x} + 3 \\sin{(x )} - 2.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496562 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "89bbbb9c-5bf7-5e11-a192-421ca39a2b26" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "- 2 x^{2} - 6 + e^{- x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496575} {:answer/id #uuid "32a5418a-1e9b-4a09-b939-e21f730687f9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-2x^2+e^{-x}-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186576129}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496575} :answer-field/id #uuid "26a9991b-4a5a-59bb-8999-d08fed4a1afe" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496557}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "540280c5-2fb8-54b1-88f4-aa5261ba0b12" :question/problem "Find the particular solution to the differential equation $g'(x)=- 4 x- e^{- x}$ that satisfies the condition $g(0)=-5.$\n\n$g(x)=\\,${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The derivative is already isolated, so we have\n\n$$\ng'(x)=- 4 x- e^{- x}.\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x,$ and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int g'(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (- 4 x- e^{- x})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ g(x) & =\\int (- 4 x)\\,\\text{d}x + \\int (- e^{- x})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ & =(-4)\\left(\\frac{x^{2}}{2}\\right) + (-1)(- e^{- x})+C \\\\ & =- 2 x^{2}+e^{- x}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo our general solution is $g(x)=- 2 x^{2}+e^{- x}+C.$ To find a particular solution, we substitute the condition $g(0)=-5$ into our solution and obtain a value for $C,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-5 & =(- 2 (0)^{2}) + (e^{- (0)})+C \\\\ -5 & =(0) + (1)+C \\\\ C & =-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our particular solution is\n\n$$\ng(x)=- 2 x^{2} - 6 + e^{- x}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186496574 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6dd041ec-76f5-576c-b5f5-4ac1e33a875d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- \\frac{4 x^{3}}{3} + 3 \\sin{(x )} - \\frac{15}{2} - \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496567} {:answer/id #uuid "71be9bd2-467c-544f-a86c-b94537352986" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=\\frac{4 x^{3}}{3} - 3 \\sin{(x )} - \\frac{17}{2} + \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496569} {:answer/id #uuid "7a56cab2-0b3b-50dc-8fac-bc8339e5496a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- \\frac{4 x^{3}}{3} + 3 \\sin{(x )} - \\frac{e^{- 2 x}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186496572} {:answer/id #uuid "b4c9a11e-69a9-5c57-a016-135f4ee342f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "f(x)=- 4 x^{2} + 3 \\cos{(x )} - 12 + e^{- 2 x}" :db/id #edb/ref 175921864